:: Player Inventory Clothes Details [nobr]

	<span style="color:Azure"><strong><big>--$PlayerInventoryClothes[$PlayerInventoryClothesSelected].Slot--</big></strong></span><br>
[img[$PlayerInventoryClothes[$PlayerInventoryClothesSelected].Icon]]
<strong><big>$PlayerInventoryClothes[$PlayerInventoryClothesSelected].Name</big></strong><br>
